{"server":"tw","storyId":"act7mini_level_act7mini_st03","groupId":"act7mini","stageId":null,"title":"真假怪談","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act7mini/level_act7mini_st03.txt","sourceHash":"8b3bebf90425297dd365820712b29f4e386c7175e8dd981e4f554ad40930bc96","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"貝娜發現安妮在看綺良打遊戲，出於好奇心，貝娜也加入了進去。在瞭解到遊戲的怪談背景後，貝娜講了個維多利亞“怪談”嚇唬對方。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"羅德島本艦\n公共休息區廊道"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......安妮又跑哪裡去玩了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"都不帶我一起玩，哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"一會看我怎麼收拾她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，走到岔路口了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"往這裡走？還是那裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，還是用老辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"（拿出一枚維多利亞錢幣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"貝娜貝娜迷路啦♪想去哪裡就聽♪它♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"巴克萊伊爵士♪指個路吧♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"（拋出錢幣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"（撿起錢幣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"往這邊走，走到底，嗯嗯，原來如此。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"唉——還有這樣的好地方啊，愛麗絲都沒和我提過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"她也沒自己說的那麼瞭解羅德島嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，找到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"安妮你這個——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"（示意貝娜小聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"（指了指電視機前的人）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）唉，她在幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"玩遊戲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"遊戲？遊戲不應該是下棋蕩鞦韆堆沙子城堡之類的嗎？這個，也是遊戲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，螢幕上是不是有個黑影子把人拖到小巷裡去了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀要是奶奶知道我們在看這種東西一定會生氣的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"有點想玩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我就知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"怪不得找不到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"那為什麼不和這個姐姐談談呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"會嚇到她的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"會嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"會的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"那就交給我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，我玩了就是你玩了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"加油。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，安妮，你覺得我這裡需要“表演”嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"好，聽你的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（快到最終篇了，也不知道能不能打出真結局。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（收集品和分支都按照給出的線索集齊了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（最後一步，打過之前的必敗戰。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（之前收集結局獎牌的時候試了一下，完全打不過。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（聽說還會轉階段，也不知道能不能贏......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"~#￥%"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摘下耳機）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，你好，有什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗚哇，我不會應付小孩子啊，怎麼辦？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"大姐姐，你在做什麼呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玩......遊戲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"遊戲？我也很喜歡玩遊戲的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以一起玩嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（現在的小孩子都這麼主動嗎？！完了，怎麼辦？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她真的會玩嗎？就算會玩，現在遊戲進度已經很末期了，每個怪都不好打，萬一她玩了體驗不好手柄一丟走了我會不會很難堪？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，唔，呃，這個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐是不方便和別人一起玩嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她，她她她她是不是要哭了？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，沒有沒有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝姐姐，姐姐你真好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的，嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我以前是不是在哪個戀愛遊戲裡見過這種橋段來著？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（算了......一會重新打吧，反正流程都很熟悉了，這個就給她玩好——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不對！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這個是恐怖懸疑動作遊戲啊，有@@有##還有**，評級是電還是絕來著？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（給小孩子玩會出問題的！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小妹妹，你看我們能不能換個遊戲玩呀，這個稍微有點——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"我就想玩這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(求求你，有點自覺吧！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一定要玩，也不是，不可以啦。但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎？！謝謝你姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝，謝什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"是用這個控制器玩嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉唉？那個，我的意思是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"是按這幾個鍵吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！出現怪物了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"嘴巴能翻這麼大嗎，好厲害啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"手柄先給姐姐一下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（暫停菜單，設置，遊戲性，關閉流血特效——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（——還有最重要的，限制不適內容出現！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？為什麼大嘴巴怪物變模糊了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼啦，手柄給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，謝謝姐姐~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這個孩子除了太主動以外好像也沒那麼麻煩嘛，又講道理嘴又甜。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（要是小的時候周圍朋友都那麼有禮貌，我現在是不是也能像宴一樣當個現充呢？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（想多了綺良，不可能的。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，哈，嘿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（快到最終大將戰了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（說起來，我剛剛只教了她基礎操作吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那套連招我也才琢磨出來沒多久。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她怎麼學會的？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（難道說，我碰上了一個隱藏動作遊戲高手？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（終於有人能幫忙打《討皇傳2橘版》的隱藏大將了嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唔......也不一定。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（先看看她能不能贏過《逃忍》這個隱藏路線的大將。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沉默的佐原，不好對付的呀。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"出動畫了耶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（開始了，夜晚的佐伯區十字路口！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"怎，怎麼砍不動啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"好像是要逃跑耶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（蘋果社就是這點討人喜歡啊，關卡連接和誘導做得特別好，連小朋友都看得懂。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，怎麼路上還有怪的，好煩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別急，慢慢來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當心，前面的車裡和路邊商店都會有怪物跳出來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對對對，實在扛不過就用路燈卡一下大將然後清怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用那招大旋風清怪會舒服點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但也別用太多啊，節省點技力打大將。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她聽得懂我在說什麼嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"走這邊，然後這——樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看來聽懂了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"哇是死路！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"不過還挺寬敞的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到大將戰階段了，這個大將正常情況下是無敵的，但你可以用道具欄裡的一個道具丟他一下，這樣無敵就沒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"哪個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個，“開光的香囊”。裝備到道具欄，正常使用就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"瞄準丟嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，機會只有一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"——打中了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大將的無敵護盾消失了，接下來用力輸出吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇好快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"千萬別輸啊，一個存檔只能挑戰一次大將，輸了就要全程重打了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"十五分鐘後"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"不能回血怎麼辦啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盯住大將他血也不多了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"注意回避和格擋！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那招擋不住的跳開快跳開！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"砍他砍他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"防反，好的！接個技能！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好，出弱點了快打！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好——好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跳成就了——過了過了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"過，過什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過真結局了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"真結局？什麼是真結局？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"我才剛剛玩沒多久啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是因為我已經玩到後面了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊正好遊戲在過製作人員名單，我先給你講講這個遊戲前面的故事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"好呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟字都看不懂，只能靠姐姐講了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（也是，遊戲沒有維多利亞語版本，虧她有耐心能玩這麼久......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳嗯，這個遊戲叫《逃忍》，就像遊戲名一樣，說的是一個逃忍離開故土在新移動城市裡生活發生的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼是忍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是......嗯......刺客，暗殺者，這樣能明白嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位刺客在服侍自己的主君，呃，領主的時候目睹領主被刺殺的過程，有人將責任栽在了他身上，於是這位刺客只能離開故土，到遠離家鄉的地方去生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"後來呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後來就到了我們的故事發生地，新安芸市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座城市是真實存在的哦，我的現充好朋友宴以前從那裡給我寄過明信片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它最大的特徵就是——都市怪談多，好多有名的怪談都出自那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且大多都是出現在這個城市被天災摧毀重建後的時間裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像是什麼不存在的車站啦，討水喝不成就會尾隨你到家並喝光家裡所有水的妖異小哥啦，喜歡出門溜達迷路了會打電話告知主人然後自己找方法回家的安芸人偶之類的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"（聽到了嗎，安妮，以後出去玩記得給我打電話。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有的很神奇，有的就特別嚇人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，製作人員名單放完了，接下來就是萬眾期待的隱藏結局！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對哦那裡有伏筆的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，哦哦，原來是這麼回事！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，後面放的動畫講了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣的，剛剛和你說了刺客到新城市生活嘛，因為擅長做暗殺和偵察的事情所以在新城市開了家偵探事務所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而前面我們打的大將，叫沉默的佐原，是新安芸市最古老的怪談。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說是夜晚在新安芸市佐伯區最繁華的十字路口，如果隻身一人走過，會遇到古東國打扮的浪人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他會用手語問你一個問題，如果答不上來、不回答或者逃跑，就會追殺你直到無盡冰原，或者他倒下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，真的會嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道啦，宴說佐伯區那個十字路口花紅酒綠的，每家酒屋都有人喝酒，一家喝完就去下一家，直到第二天早晨才回家換衣服去上班，根本沒人見過不說話的浪人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"酒屋？是喝葡萄汁的地方嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，是哦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之！這個遊戲最後的隱藏結局就是告訴你，整個城市的怪談都是從最古老的怪談上開始衍生，然後像樹根一樣滲透進城市的各個角落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"佐原希望讓這個屬於東國的移動城市成為外人無法接觸到的怪談之城，最終以此為基點，將東國化為怪談的樂園！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜他遇到了主角這個深入探查脈絡的外人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後，主角擊敗了原始的怪談，瞭解到這座城市的秘密，於是整個大樹分崩離析，城市也變回了普普通通的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"只是因為打敗了大將？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為怪談就是要足夠神秘，被人銘記才能生存和傳播啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果被知道真相，神秘感消失，許多怪談都會立刻不成立的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那樣它們存在的意義就消失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"（哦？哦——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"（真巧，我也想讓這位姐姐“記住”些什麼。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"（就這樣做吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐好像很開心呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打通隱藏劇情了，當然超級開心啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——也不知道最新的遊戲什麼時候能送到——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先回宿舍——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，能等一下嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想給姐姐講個故事，可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐講了那麼久，我什麼都沒說，也怪不好意思的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"啊稍等一下，姐姐你一定口渴了吧，我幫你倒杯水。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她也......太主動了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（怎麼回事？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我真的變得受歡迎了嗎？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，水來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"（上鉤了~）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，我也來給姐姐講個維多利亞的都市怪談吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"作為......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"（謝禮。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"謝禮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還挺少有人會主動和我說話的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我叫綺良，小妹妹你怎麼稱呼啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以先賣個關子嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"嘻嘻，謝謝姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"故事從維多利亞一個叫做林頓的地方開始——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"又下雨了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"也不知道爸爸媽媽在哪裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"算啦，想他們也沒用，還不如一碗熱湯來得實在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貧民窟居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，卡普里尼小鬼，你待在我家門口幹嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"避雨啊，還能幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貧民窟居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，維多利亞語都說不清楚還敢坐這裡？滾回你的萊塔尼亞去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貧民窟居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"沒聽明白？滾出去，老子的大門不歡迎你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"我就坐一會避避雨，又不會到你家裡面去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貧民窟居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"唷，你還想？！*惡毒的維多利亞詞彙*，老子跟那長角領班關係不好挨罵也就算了，你一個小毛孩還敢頂嘴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貧民窟居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"給老子滾！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"好疼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"換個地方避雨吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"實在不行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"從城市邊緣下去......應該也不會太疼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊也有人摔倒了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"好像是個......老奶奶？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，奶奶，你還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你啊，小羊崽。這年頭還願意扶老婆子一把的孩子可不多啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"這周圍的孩子呀，一個個的就知道找老婆子我要蘋果，想找他們幫幫忙呢，人就一下子全不見啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"難得有你這麼個熱心腸的好孩子，真好，真好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"老奶奶你衣服都髒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是啊，小羊崽。看，你這還有傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事的，淋淋雨一會就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"笨羊崽啊，你這樣淋，一會著涼怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"快回家去吧，老婆子家近，一個人慢慢晃總能到家的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"別讓家裡人擔心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"我......沒有家......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸媽媽讓我在噴泉廣場等他們回來，然後就再也沒出現過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣嗎，可憐的小羊羔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"說來也巧啊，老婆子我一個人住，孤單得很。小羊羔要是不嫌棄啊，可以陪老婆子聊聊天嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"聊天......也不是不可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"（至少能避雨。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯嚯，謝謝你啊，小羊羔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，你怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"老了啊，不中用了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"小羊羔，能不能麻煩你幫老婆子提下果籃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"裡面都是老婆子我剛摘的蘋果。現在這一摔，還得提著重重的籃子，手腳啊它使不上勁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"小羊羔你力氣大，能幫個忙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"交給我吧，奶奶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，奶奶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼下雨天摘蘋果啊，雨那麼大，待在家裡不好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯嚯嚯，你不懂的，小羊羔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"只有這雨洗刷過的蘋果，才是又香又甜的好蘋果啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，是這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"是了是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"稍等一下啊，老婆子我找找鑰匙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"有了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"請進吧小羊羔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎回家。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，好暖和！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好漂亮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯嚯嚯，這種奉承老婆子我喜歡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"等一等啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，傷口，不疼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"老婆子我雖然沒什麼能力，但治療小傷口還是能辦到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"想不想換套好看的衣服？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"那跟老婆子來吧，就在樓上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡，好暗啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"因為這裡是老婆子那可愛孫女安眠的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"安眠？奶奶，你不是一個人住嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，老婆子我一直都一個“人”住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"來，見見我的可愛孫女。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"這是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"這個娃娃，和我差不多大耶，好精緻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是老婆子的孫女了，她呀，叫安妮，是個可愛的卡普里尼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"和你一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"老婆子我啊，一直在找一樣東西，今天終於在小羊羔你身上找到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經幫了老婆子好多忙了，老婆子很感激你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，能幫老婆子最後一個忙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶你說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"啊謝謝你，可愛的小羊羔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，請閉上眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"小羊羔啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"把你可口的，善良的靈魂——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"交出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說這樣誘拐孤兒的案例在整個維多利亞都有發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"偶爾目睹老婦帶走孤兒的人都說，自己再也沒見過那一晚的孤兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"當然啦，警察叔叔們也從來沒查出來什麼東西，上門搜查的時候，要麼發現那戶人家根本沒有老人，要嘛就是空房。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，好像每戶人家的孩子都有一個叫做安妮的玩偶呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結，結束了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"綺良姐姐覺得怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還，還可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"這個已經是維多利亞的老故事啦，聽說現在城市裡有許多新變體，比如——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以了！謝謝你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐不喜歡的話我就不說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"只是呢，這個故事無論怎麼變化，有一個東西是不變的哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別，別說了，我，真的不太擅長聽這種。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"玩遊戲就可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玩遊戲是另外一回事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐說的有道理呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"安妮，來打個招呼吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，綺良姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"我是安妮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"嘻嘻，真好玩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，我表演得還不錯吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"貝娜太過火了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"你放心，我之後會去好好和綺良姐姐賠禮道歉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"還有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"還有什麼嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"你忘記告訴姐姐了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，別計較這個，到時候會去做自我介紹的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛，編的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"那當然，貝娜講故事的能力可要比愛麗絲強多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼講，奶奶會生氣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"嫌棄你講得不夠壞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——？還不夠壞嗎，我覺得已經把奶奶說得很壞了呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......你這麼一說，好像是差了點感覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"當初奶奶笑嘻嘻地和我說，如果那天拿著果籃拔腿就跑，我這一輩子的食物就會只剩那五個蘋果了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"後面把我領到餐廳然後去洗澡換衣服的時候更過分，要是我敢吃餐廳的大餐就會瞬間回到風雨交加的街道上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"那次是真的，到現在還記得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"給幼小的我留下心理陰影了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶說的是實話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說她壞啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"也不知道奶奶當初是怎麼進夢城堡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"可能因為她是個壞好人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"你不壞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，這時候怎麼想起來討好我了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"老實交代，安妮，你是不是之前玩過這個遊戲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"那還把我引到這裡來，想什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"我玩過了，好玩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你也玩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣啊，怪不得總覺得自己對遊戲操控特別熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"玩幾小時了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"三個晚上，二十四小時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"二十四？！你睡覺的時候偷偷溜出去了？這樣真要被奶奶罵的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"有你在，不怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"過來安妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"來，坐我身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然剛剛通了關，但前面的關一點都沒打。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"你手把手教我吧，好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"還有一個小問題，剛剛綺良姐姐一直在說的大將是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"Boss。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，原來是這個啊，我還以為是什麼新奇東西呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"開始了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"哦好，現在要專心打遊戲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"你說，我們嚇唬綺良姐姐的東西，真的會在她的國家裡生根發芽，變成新的“怪談”嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_152","isRemote":false,"text":"專心，貝娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"噢哦，好，對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"按這個鍵對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_151","isRemote":false,"text":"開始遊戲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
